# Per-cluster ancestry composition

**What this is.** One stacked horizontal bar per ``cluster_id``. Bar
segments are sample counts under FLARE's primary ancestry (argmax over
the per-sample proportion vector at chr1, where every sample appears
exactly once). Clusters are sorted by total sample count, largest at
the top. The cohort-pooled view is in the previous section; this
section shows where each cluster sits relative to that pool.

